WEBVTT

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.816
na nikaanza kuunganisha hadithi zangu

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:36.576
na hadithi za wenzangu na
wapigania uhuru,

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:42.216
ambao, kama mimi, waliona
madhara hatari vya ubaguzi wa rangi,

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:45.496
na mabao walipoteza marafiki njiani,

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:49.320
na ambao wenyewe
walipigwa na kutupwa jela.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.600
Ni miaka 50 baadae.